# ---- Generated SQLite databases ----------------------------------------
# The database is rebuilt locally via `uv run python data/build_database.py`,
# so it is never committed. This also covers WAL/SHM files and the throwaway
# demo databases the notebooks create.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/retail.db
data/demo_bank.db

